1. OBJECTIVE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Build a minimal native-Android Gradle app that starts the existing Flask app
through Chaquopy (CPython 3.11 embedded in the APK), serves it on 127.0.0.1 and
shows it in an Android WebView; install on Waydroid and capture on-device proof.
(src/ unmodified.)

2. TOOLCHAIN USED (all user-space under android/spike/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Chaquopy        17.2.0            (com.chaquo.python gradle plugin, from Maven Central)
Android Gradle  8.7.2             (AGP)
Gradle          8.9               tools/gradle-8.9   (GRADLE_USER_HOME = android/spike/.gradle-home)
JDK             Temurin 17.0.21   tools/jdk17
Android SDK     34 (build-tools 34.0.0, platforms;android-34) — no NDK needed (Chaquopy ships prebuilt libs)
app python      3.11  (Chaquopy runtime libpython3.11.so)
build python    /home/user/.local/bin/python3.11 (3.11.15) via chaquopy buildPython
                (Chaquopy needs a build-machine Python matching the app version for
                 pip install of requirements + bytecode compilation)

