6. FAILURE MODES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1) Same-package install did not replace the running PATH-A app.
   Cause: p4a produced versionCode 10241 while Chaquopy produced versionCode 1 ->
   Android rejects the downgrade; `waydroid app install` still returned rc=0.
   `waydroid app remove` fails with code -3, and non-root cannot signal the
   container's app process (kill -> EPERM).
   FIX: rebuild PATH-B with applicationId com.dkbondtracker.pathb so both APKs can
   coexist and the proof is unambiguous.
2) Screen/DPMS blanking produced all-black captures (no GNOME top bar visible).
   `waydroid show-full-ui` also exited immediately in that window. Retrying the
   capture once the session was active produced correct images. No code impact.
3) (environment, same as P2) no waydroid logcat/shell (root), no grim (no
   wlr-screencopy), GNOME D-Bus screenshot blocked, no adb (container has no IPv4).
   Proof method = flameshot full-screen with the Waydroid window in front.

